  "scope": [
    "Add a human-readable model status to each active Agent card in Team without treating a model as a permanent Agent property.",
    "Resolve model evidence from active registered task observations first, otherwise the latest correlated observation, while preserving requested versus effective model differences and unknown states.",
    "Keep the private LAN viewer read-only and responsive, document the evidence boundary, and verify the Team view in a real browser."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "Each active Agent card shows Active model, Last observed model, Requested model, or No model observation according to available evidence.",
    "Effective or correlated observed model takes precedence over requested model; a requested-only value is never presented as observed execution.",
    "Reasoning effort, task or Work Item provenance, and observation time are shown only when known without exposing prompt content or credentials.",
    "The Team view remains usable at wide desktop, tablet, and mobile widths and the LAN viewer remains read-only.",
    "Focused tests, full repository verification, and runtime visual review pass before organizational closeout."
  ],
